            "Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block's settings \u2192 After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.": [
                "P\u0159ipojte slu\u017ebu e-mailingov\u00e9ho seznamu jednou; pot\u00e9 m\u016f\u017ee libovoln\u00fd formul\u00e1\u0159 p\u0159idat lidi, kte\u0159\u00ed jej vypln\u00ed, do jednoho z va\u0161ich seznam\u016f (nastaven\u00ed bloku formul\u00e1\u0159e \u2192 Po odesl\u00e1n\u00ed). Kl\u00ed\u010de jsou ov\u011b\u0159eny u slu\u017eby, ulo\u017eeny v \u0161ifrovan\u00e9 podob\u011b na tomto webu a ji\u017e se nikdy nezobraz\u00ed."
            ],
            "Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a \"Conversion event\" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.": [
                "Odes\u00edlejte odesl\u00e1n\u00ed formul\u00e1\u0159\u016f a kliknut\u00ed na tla\u010d\u00edtka do sv\u00e9 analytiky bez nutnosti psan\u00ed k\u00f3du. Ponech\u00e1te-li ID pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9, tato slu\u017eba se p\u0159esko\u010d\u00ed. Tla\u010d\u00edtka z\u00edskaj\u00ed v pokro\u010dil\u00e9m panelu pole \u201eKonverzn\u00ed ud\u00e1lost\u201c. Pokud je li\u0161ta soubor\u016f cookie zapnut\u00e1, nic se nena\u010dte, dokud s t\u00edm n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edk nebude souhlasit."
            ],
