            "Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.": [
                "Vypn\u011bte, pokud je ji\u017e va\u0161e \u0161ablona nebo jin\u00fd plugin p\u0159id\u00e1v\u00e1; ud\u00e1losti se p\u0159esto odes\u00edlaj\u00ed."
