            "Event name for form submissions": [
                "N\u00e1zev ud\u00e1losti pro odesl\u00e1n\u00ed formul\u00e1\u0159e"
            ],
            "The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for \"save\"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays \"denied\", and the scripts you list stay switched off.": [
                "Banner je vyskakovac\u00ed okno, kter\u00e9 navrhnete pomoc\u00ed blok\u016f. Jeho tla\u010d\u00edtka vedou na #consent-accept, #consent-reject a #consent-save (s pol\u00ed\u010dky za\u0161krtnut\u00ed pojmenovan\u00fdmi analytics a marketing pro \u201eulo\u017eit\u201c); odkaz na #consent-open jej kdekoli op\u011bt zobrazi. Dokud n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edk souhlas neud\u011bl\u00ed, sledovac\u00ed zna\u010dky se nena\u010dtou, Google Consent Mode z\u016fstane v re\u017eimu \u201edenied\u201c a skripty, kter\u00e9 uvedete, z\u016fstanou vypnut\u00e9."
            ],
            "Create a ready-made banner": [
